{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/d7quwa","slideIndex":4,"text":"VIDEO TIMING\n2:09-2:21 (12 seconds)\n\nNARRATION\nI tested ten staged room images containing thirty-five reference hazards. SafeHome AI correctly reported thirty-four and missed one, for a ninety-seven point one percent detection rate.\n\nNEXT APP CLIP\n2:21-2:46 - Clip D: Show the room dashboard, score trend, before-and-after comparison, add an email recipient, and briefly open Accessibility. Narration: Saved checks track progress by room. The dashboard shows trends and comparisons, summaries can go to trusted people, and accessibility controls remain available throughout the app."}
